  "releaseNotes": "Stable 1.4.1 release. Retains the 68000 trace-exception correction and reduces interpreter stack initialization with out-of-line prefetch helpers. Improves fixed-batch instruction-prefetch throughput by extracting the general bus-prefetch path and avoids deferred interrupt-sample resolution when no deferred-timing provider is present. No public API or emulated bus-order changes. CPU validation: 1,499 tests passed; six optional external conformance suites were not run.",
